{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\eng\\074.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Use of 'will / shiali", "conf": 0.819, "box": [[291, 150], [582, 136], [584, 172], [293, 186]]}, {"text": "for giving information about the future", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[344, 201], [929, 163], [932, 205], [347, 244]]}, {"text": "Example: It will be dusty, close your window.", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[344, 250], [1005, 206], [1008, 251], [347, 295]]}, {"text": "for predicting what we think or guess will happen", "conf": 0.93, "box": [[339, 347], [1084, 301], [1087, 348], [342, 393]]}, {"text": "Example: Well have a great time!", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[344, 400], [836, 374], [838, 411], [346, 437]]}, {"text": "For asking or suggesting what to do (use shall)", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[331, 494], [1039, 457], [1041, 507], [334, 544]]}, {"text": "Example: What shall I bring with me?", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[337, 545], [888, 523], [890, 562], [339, 585]]}, {"text": "Present sinmpie", "conf": 0.759, "box": [[275, 624], [513, 615], [515, 655], [277, 664]]}, {"text": "for timetables and schedules", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[331, 676], [766, 661], [767, 697], [333, 712]]}, {"text": "Examples:", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[334, 723], [488, 723], [488, 761], [334, 761]]}, {"text": "I leave on Wednesday.", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[328, 772], [666, 768], [667, 803], [328, 807]]}, {"text": "The school timetable shows that the maths class is on Tuesday and Thursday.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[325, 809], [1515, 775], [1517, 830], [327, 865]]}, {"text": "A contraction is a word", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[1328, 905], [1653, 917], [1652, 956], [1327, 944]]}, {"text": "to the football club at 5:00 p.m.", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[331, 923], [794, 913], [795, 947], [331, 957]]}, {"text": "made by shortening and", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[1327, 944], [1663, 959], [1661, 1002], [1326, 987]]}, {"text": "combining two words", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[1329, 987], [1629, 998], [1628, 1035], [1328, 1024]]}, {"text": "Future cotsinuous", "conf": 0.805, "box": [[266, 1017], [561, 1019], [561, 1052], [266, 1050]]}, {"text": "using the apostrophe", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[1327, 1028], [1625, 1037], [1624, 1074], [1326, 1065]]}, {"text": "saying that something will be in progress at a time in the future", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[323, 1071], [1285, 1046], [1286, 1089], [325, 1114]]}, {"text": "Example: we'll (we + will)", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[1328, 1067], [1661, 1079], [1660, 1116], [1327, 1103]]}, {"text": "can't (can + not)", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[1445, 1110], [1661, 1123], [1658, 1157], [1443, 1144]]}, {"text": "Example: We'll be driving to Lahore soon.", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[328, 1122], [939, 1111], [939, 1146], [328, 1158]]}, {"text": "(ou + op) 1,uop", "conf": 0.797, "box": [[1453, 1148], [1663, 1162], [1660, 1198], [1451, 1184]]}, {"text": "Fill in the blanks with the correct present continuous tense", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[319, 1191], [1264, 1176], [1264, 1216], [319, 1231]]}, {"text": "I've (I + have)", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[1452, 1189], [1644, 1199], [1643, 1235], [1450, 1225]]}, {"text": "such as 'going to', 'will' and 'shall'.", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[319, 1235], [868, 1225], [868, 1265], [319, 1274]]}, {"text": "There", "conf": 0.832, "box": [[320, 1297], [420, 1299], [419, 1334], [319, 1332]]}, {"text": "a.", "conf": 0.663, "box": [[261, 1302], [292, 1302], [292, 1333], [261, 1333]]}, {"text": " be heavy snow tomorrow.", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[544, 1298], [935, 1293], [935, 1330], [545, 1335]]}, {"text": "b.", "conf": 0.657, "box": [[260, 1368], [300, 1368], [300, 1402], [260, 1402]]}, {"text": "It", "conf": 0.663, "box": [[314, 1368], [353, 1368], [353, 1402], [314, 1402]]}, {"text": "be windy all day.", "conf": 0.84, "box": [[444, 1368], [692, 1368], [692, 1405], [444, 1405]]}, {"text": "I am'", "conf": 0.653, "box": [[316, 1438], [402, 1438], [402, 1472], [316, 1472]]}, {"text": "to the office after the rain.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[533, 1437], [922, 1434], [922, 1469], 